# Repairs: from frame 10 console 1 lowers its promise, stamps a message
# below it, asks past it and asks past its frame end, each once a frame,
# and in frame 13 makes no frame-end publish. The bus repairs the first
# four and counts all five. Frame 14 follows the frame with no publish,
# so the bus knows no frame end there and repairs nothing past it.
console 0 core=test
console 1 core=test
option 0 link_test_seed 2
option 1 link_test_mode nonconform
option 1 link_test_bad_frame 10
expect-count lowered_promise 50
expect-count low_stamp 50
expect-count request_past_promise 50
expect-count request_past_frame_end 49
expect-count skipped_publish 1
0 cable 0:0 1:0
30 save mid
30 checkpoint in_flight
40 checkpoint middle
60 end
